2. Replace only 75 validation pairs from:
       validation/outdoors_crosscountry_00
3. Preserve each removed pair_id and pose_bin.
4. Use the original candidate pool v2 constraints.
5. Prefer low source/target reuse.
6. Balance replacement pairs across remaining validation sequences.
7. Add official SMPL depth/normal paths to train/val/test manifests.
8. Never modify v1 files.

Geometry provenance
-------------------
3DPW official SMPL + official camera.
outdoors_crosscountry_00 is excluded from the geometry-complete dataset.
"""

